<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-BORDER 180-5 AT TEA AGAINST E.P.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-BORDER 180-5 AT TEA AGAINST E.P.</headline>
<dateline>EAST LONDON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Border were 180 for five in their first innings at tea on the opening day of their four-day Supersport Series cricket match against Eastern Province at Buffalo Park on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>Border 180-5 in 73 overs (Mark Boucher 39 not out; Dave Callaghan 2-10).</p>
